(7606592, 1230039, 114969, '<td valign="top">How brave, a colored take on a B&amp;W classic! Only Lydia would attempt such stunt. It looks quite good! Did you also try to use someone else''s hand to hold the shard, like in the Apal''kin version? It could be fun, associated to your warm/cold color approach. Anyways, congrats on the well deserved ribbon, great one!</td>', 'How brave, a colored take on a B&W classic! Only Lydia would attempt such stunt. It looks quite good! Did you also try to use someone else''s hand to hold the shard, like in the Apal''kin version? It could be fun, associated to your warm/cold color approach. Anyways, congrats on the well deserved ribbon, great one!', '2019-01-02 07:50:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7606593, 1229979, 114969, '<td valign="top">Ok, now I am wondering how to build a compass that would actually draw squares. It would be so fun to see one of these work for real :) Thanks for the inspiration and the great concept, and congrats on the ribbon!</td>', 'Ok, now I am wondering how to build a compass that would actually draw squares. It would be so fun to see one of these work for real :) Thanks for the inspiration and the great concept, and congrats on the ribbon!', '2019-01-02 07:53:22.000000', NULL, 0),
